# Generated fixture output under src/ is intentionally committed (plan #04
# decision: freshness-gated like @lifegames/schemas + @lifegames/copy).
# src/generated/**/*.json (raw pre-adapter) and src/post-adapter/*.ts +
# src/post-adapter/*.json (post-adapter display shapes) are produced by
# `scripts/generate.ts` and MUST be committed so the freshness git-diff gate
# can detect drift and reviewers see the output. Regenerate with
# `pnpm -F @lifegames/fixtures build`.
#
# The root .gitignore only ignores dist/, not src/, so nothing here needs
# negating — this file documents intent only.
